# Anchored. These come from the Python packaging block, and a bare
# `lib/` matches any directory of that name at any depth — it was
# excluding `services/ui/src/frontend/lib/`, 442 files of interface
# source, from the repository. The build failed in CI with
# "Cannot find module './lib/role-utils'" against a checkout that
# genuinely did not have it.
